  ./COVERAGE.md:1058:| `org.bouncycastle:bc-fips` | [2.1.2<br>- 2.1.3](metadata/org.bouncycastle/bc-fips/index.json) | <details><summary>Show</summary> BC-FIPS is Bouncy Castle's FIPS 140-3 certified Java cryptographic provider and low-level API, implementing approved algorithms for use through JCE and direct APIs. Version 2.1.2 patches the 2.1 series and adds optional Intel native acceleration for AES-NI and SHA-256 on supported platforms.</details> | [24.7% (18/73 calls)](stats/org.bouncycastle/bc-fips/) |
