ally\n configured DRBG.</div>\n<dd><code>entropySource</code> - a SecureRandom which can act as an entropy source. (now ignored)</dd>\n<section class=\"detail\" id=\"configure(java.lang.String)\">\n<h3>configure</h3>\n<div class=\"member-signature\"><span class=\"modifiers\">public</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"return-type\"><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\" class=\"external-link\">Provider</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"element-name\">configure</span><wbr><span class=\"parameters\">(<a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\" class=\"external-link\">String</a>&nbsp;configArg)</span></div>\n<dd><code><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.html#configure(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\" class=\"external-link\">configure</a></code>&nbsp;in class&nbsp;<code><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Provider.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\" class=\"external-link\">Provider</a></code></dd>\n<section class=\"detail\" id=\"getDefaultSecureRandom()\">\n<h3>getDefaultSecureRandom</h3>\n<div class=\"member-signature\"><span class=\"modifiers\">public</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"return-type\"><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/SecureRandom.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\" class=\"external-link\">SecureRandom</a></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"element-name\">getDefaultSecureRandom</span>()</div>\n<dd>the security strength for the default SecureRandom the provider uses.</dd>\n<div class=\"member-signature\"><span class=\"modifiers\">public final</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"return-type\"><a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/21/docs/api/java.base/java/security/Pro