tive-image, matching the artifact's multi-release layout used by existing bc-fips coverage.\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"If native acceleration is not disabled, tests may depend on host CPU features, temp-directory native library extraction, and bundled native library loading rather than portable reachability metadata.\",\n    \"Approved-only FIPS mode is a separate usage mode; only set org.bouncycastle.fips.approved_only if the generated test intentionally covers approved-only behavior.\"\n  ]\n}", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c3e85743ecc52aa016a803e2f317081919912535b21cc7f46\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.5", "usage": {"input": 7525, "output": 791, "cacheRead": 33280, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 501, "totalTokens": 41596, "cost": {"input": 0.037625000000000006, "output": 0.02373, "cacheRead": 0.01664, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.07799500000000001}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1786789412955, "responseId": "resp_0c3e85743ecc52aa016a803e25160c8191b68e3d2720c72e57", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
